A description separator left of its item's column folds into the definition body

```
- item

  :: Term
  :  Def
 :  under
.
<ul>
  <li>item
    <dl>
      <dt>Term</dt>
      <dd>Def
:  under</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- item

  :: Term
  :  Def
:  under
.
<ul>
  <li>item
    <dl>
      <dt>Term</dt>
      <dd>Def</dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>:  under</p>
```

